        "description": "Whole-list replace: an entry with no `id` is created, one with an existing `id` is edited in place, and an id from the OLD list simply absent from the new one is deleted. Prefer POST /resume/targets (create one) or PATCH/DELETE /resume/targets/{id} for a single, targeted change -- this route resends and re-persists the ENTIRE list.\n",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
